    "type": "text",
    "text": "We are at the root of nix -> pi -> flake -> cargo stack. Give a list of query command that can be used to query the information at nix level. Test them."
  }
]
[
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "It is not a directory stack but run time stack."
  }
]
[
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "You need to run and fix each program. Do not make up results."
  }
]
[
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "Do not worry about flake yet per instruction."
  }
]
[
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "You are doing too much. One command at a time."
  }
]
[
